# MAINTAINERS — the canonical list of GitHub handles that may review code.
#
# Every @handle (individual or @org/team) referenced in .github/CODEOWNERS
# must be declared here, and the `make check-github` gate enforces it, so
# review routing can never silently point at a misspelled or made-up account.
#
# One bare handle per line (no leading @). A team uses its org name — the part
# before the slash — e.g. `@godofecht/games-team` is allowed because
# `godofecht` is listed below. To add a maintainer, add their real GitHub
# handle here first, then assign them in CODEOWNERS.

godofecht
